# Kill-Switch — {{project_name}}

The kill-switch is the operator's single control to halt all autonomous activity in {{project_name}}.

**When to complete this file:** fill in a capability entry the first time this project enables an autonomous capability (a scheduled run, a parallel build, a write-back capability). Do not fill it in speculatively at INIT — a project with no enabled automation leaves this file empty.

For the required properties this implementation must satisfy, and the rationale, see `core/methodology/rollback-kill-switch.md`.

